OL,3,GNEWSAZionism is racist, says Scottish
OL,4,AGreen co-leader Ross Greer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-leader of the Scottish Greens
OL,7,Fhas described Zionism as racist, after
OL,8,Fthe claim was adopted as Green Party
OL,9,Fpolicy south of the border.
OL,11,FRoss Greer said, while he did not agree
OL,12,Fwith all parts of a motion passed at
OL,13,Fthe England and Wales Green Party
OL,14,Fconference, he considered the creation
OL,15,Fof Israel to have been "an act of
OL,16,Fracism".
OL,18,FSome Jewish groups have called the
OL,19,FGreen Party motion an "attack on the
OL,20,FJewish community", and Israel's foreign
OL,21,Fministry said it was "a stain on the
OL,22,Fhistory of the United Kingdom".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
